1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,280
WOMAN: Did you see the list of activities taking place at the community center that was released today?

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:09,064
MAN: Not yet. Is there anything on there that looks interesting?

3
00:00:09,064 --> 00:00:12,160
I'd love to do some fun activities this summer.

4
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:15,173
WOMAN: I'm thinking of taking part in the fishing contest.

5
00:00:15,173 --> 00:00:19,090
Would you like to join me? We can be on the same team.

6
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:24,030
MAN: Okay, that sounds good to me. Do we have to pay a fee to enter?

7
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:28,074
WOMAN: I don't, because I'm a member of the community center,

8
00:00:28,074 --> 00:00:33,220
but since you don't belong to it, it will cost you $15 to enter.
